    "font" : "Courier",
    "font size" : 7.266,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "PESEN. Peas. This is the common early form of the word, and occurs in Chaucer, Legende of Good Women, 648. Holloway gives the following couplet, as seen lately on a board in a pea-field in Berkshire"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
